        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pat Ashton, Harry Booth, Reg Varney, Doris Hare, Bob Hoskins, John Thaw\n- Products: On the Buses, Mutiny on the Buses, Thick as Thieves\n- Topics: English TV-sitcom film spin-offs, British comedy film, television series\n\nFacts:\n- In 1971, \"On the Buses\" was released as a British comedy film directed by Harry Booth and starring Reg Varney and Doris Hare.\n- Pat Ashton is best remembered for her engaging cockney, blonde persona in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off \"On the Buses\" in 1971.\n- In 1972, Pat Ashton is best remembered for her engaging cockney, blonde persona in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off \"Mutiny on the Buses.\"\n- \"Thick as Thieves\" was a television series with one series comprising 8 episodes.\n- \"Thick as Thieves\" starred Bob Hoskins, John Thaw, and Pat Ashton.",
